+# Verifier Calibration & Readiness Checklist
+
+Follow this checklist before enabling verifier-based auto-gating in CI or Argo promotions.
+
+1) Data readiness
+ - [ ] Representative validation set collected and reviewed by SMEs.
+ - [ ] Adversarial sample set curated and stored at ops/factuality/adversarial_samples.jsonl.
+ - [ ] Fairness metadata present for subgroup analysis.
+
+2) Finetune reproducibility
+ - [ ] Finetune run recorded with runmeta.json (manifest SHA, seed, model name).
+ - [ ] Training artifacts stored in artifact registry and signed.
+
+3) Calibration
+ - [ ] Run calibrate_and_publish.py to compute thresholds.json.
+ - [ ] thresholds.json uploaded to ConfigMap verifier-calib in safety namespace.
+ - [ ] Calibration artifact registered in metadata service.
+
+4) Validation battery
+ - [ ] Validation battery executed with success on candidate.
+ - [ ] Adversarial and fairness tests pass (or passed with documented exceptions).
+ - [ ] Validation metrics written to candidate/validation_metrics.json
+
+5) SME signoff
+ - [ ] SME approval request created & approved via manual-approval service.
+ - [ ] SME signoff entry recorded in services/factuality/sme_signoff.py store.
+
+6) CI gate
+ - [ ] verifier_smoke_test validated in CI; will block promotion if thresholds missing or gate fails.
+
+7) Monitoring & rollback
+ - [ ] Canary evaluation configured with time window and automated rollback hook (promote-exit-handler).
